  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agroforestry, NTFPs, PFM and piloting of timber harvesting and FSC national standard development are the major components of the program. The intervention areas are located in Southwest Ethiopia at the intersection of three regions (Gambella, Oromia and Southwest Peoples&#x2019; Regional State (SWPRS) specifically within three ecological zones namely Agnwa in Gambela, Ilu Ababor in Oromia and Sheka in SWPRS.</narrative>
  </description>
